sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as Sfumato CLI or TUI
    participant App as SfumatoApplication
    participant Provider as CodexAppServerProvider
    participant Server as codex app-server
    participant Tools as Sfumato ToolExecutor

    User->>CLI: generate slides or page
    CLI->>App: typed generation command
    App->>Provider: generate(rendered prompts, tools)
    Provider->>Server: initialize(experimentalApi=true)
    Provider->>Server: initialized
    Provider->>Server: model/list
    Server-->>Provider: authenticated model catalog
    Provider->>Server: thread/start(model, cwd, system prompt, dynamicTools)
    Server-->>Provider: ephemeral thread
    Provider->>Server: turn/start(user prompt)
    loop Native model tool loop
        Server-->>Provider: item/tool/call
        Provider-->>CLI: tool requested event
        Provider->>Tools: execute(name, arguments)
        Tools-->>Provider: structured result
        Provider-->>CLI: tool result event
        Provider->>Server: dynamic tool response
    end
    Server-->>Provider: item/completed(agentMessage)
    Server-->>Provider: turn/completed
    Provider-->>App: generated text
    App-->>CLI: artifacts and provenance
    CLI-->>User: readable result
